Z||000009||Jaei Sun||11-11-2001||10:01 PM||||I think the cop was starting to write up a ticket for loitering and Rick talked to the cop and I didn't see the cop handing the ticket to him so I guess he just let Rick go.  I believe he was going to go down the line handing out tickets to everyone there.<P>When everyone scattered, Carl (Filtyscarecrow) and I lost all ya guys, Oh well. I saw that sweet mid-engine cart that he mentioned at porkeys.  And got a better idea about how to work with carbon-fiber cloth.  We came up with some cool ideas for our cars.<P>I found out that hood that was on that Electron Blue Civic Si & Got a few pictures of it... I will be **trying** to reproduce a few vents on it for my car.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/1hood4.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by Jaei Sun (edited 11-12-2001).]||||reg||1
