Z||000014||86seyellow||11-12-2001||08:55 AM||||Hey guys. When the cop was writing, i went right up to him and asked what the problem was. He said he told everone to go and want going to deal with it, so he was towing. I told him to tow me and I would have his badge. I am parking in a lot, doing nothing wrong. I also told him I was a Fruniture rep and was chcking out the store behind me. After he told me to go a second time I asked for his badge #. He then got in his car. I am caling St Paul and going to file a harrassment complaint todya. Anyhow it was fun getting together. I just hate cocky cops.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/86seyellow_new1.JPG"> <BR>All Stock plus goodies||||reg||1
Z||000015||Standard||11-12-2001||08:08 PM||||don't feel like posting a new topic.. so i'll just put my little tale here and bump this up to the top..<P>So i'm outside in my garage replacing my already hollow cat with a straight pipe because the cat is rattling.  I have the downpipe off, and i'm thinking.. hmmm.. wonder what this thing sounds like with no exhaust..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Just an open header.  So I hop in the car and just about piss myself when it starts up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> holy jebus that thing is <B>loud</B>!!  Only ran it for a few seconds like that... I'm sure I annoyed a few neighbors.  hehehe||||reg||1
Z||000016||Tina||11-12-2001||08:45 PM||||Darn it, I'am starting to regret leaving when  I did.<BR>...the race car, the quad4 on the dyno,<BR>86seyellow versus St Paul Police.<P>But the last thing I needed is the cop to start looking at my car.<BR>(Kinda like it without the front plate)<P>Anyways, had fun.<BR>Tina<P>BTW So Standard,...did your ears stop ringing yet from your experiment.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>               ||||reg||1
